{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"x":0.084775084986796076,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.061046511688499394,"w":0.10726643880208332},{"t":"PHIL:","x":0.084775086094465976,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.11046511604810372,"w":0.031141869227091473,"c":1},{"w":0.0346020762125651,"c":1,"h":0.010174418263205198,"t":"LUCY:","y":0.12645348850890126,"x":0.086505190186681707},{"y":0.14244186024467331,"x":0.084775086056106203,"w":0.031141869227091473,"t":"PHIL:","h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1},{"t":"LUCY:","y":0.19040697653025729,"w":0.036332181294759111,"c":1,"x":0.08477508573670349,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"y":0.22238372076490032,"w":0.029411764144897462,"x":0.086505190505405949,"c":1,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"t":"PHIL:"},{"c":1,"t":"LUCY:","y":0.25436046526277734,"w":0.036332181294759111,"x":0.08477508573670349,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"w":0.031141869227091487,"h":0.011627907349230915,"y":0.28488372064709,"t":"PHIL:","c":1,"x":0.084775086234205127},{"t":"PHIL:","y":0.32267441836995825,"x":0.083044983242484577,"w":0.032871971130371075,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"x":0.084775085746880585,"h":0.011627907349230804,"t":"LUCY:","y":0.37063953466327781,"w":0.036332181294759125,"c":1},{"y":0.40261627890443519,"x":0.086505190505405949,"t":"PHIL:","c":1,"w":0.029411764144897462,"h":0.0087209305119231306},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"t":"LUCY:","y":0.45058139549533549,"w":0.036332181294759111,"c":1,"x":0.08477508573670349},{"x":0.084775086066283298,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"y":0.4665697672765281,"w":0.031141869227091459,"c":1,"t":"PHIL:"},{"h":0.0095137288471967008,"t":"LUCY:","x":0.086369293179605747,"w":0.034873870213826499,"c":1,"y":0.49815011230078365},{"t":"PHIL:","y":0.54505813931230318,"c":1,"x":0.084775086061194757,"w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.011627907349230693},{"t":"LUCY:","y":0.56104651134476435,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.036332178115844729,"x":0.084775087513588587,"c":1},{"x":0.084775086066283298,"w":0.031141869227091459,"h":0.011627907349230804,"t":"PHIL:","y":0.57703488350048715,"c":1},{"t":"LUCY:","c":1,"y":0.62500000014246071,"x":0.084775085751121027,"w":0.036332181294759111,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"y":0.67296511611373755,"t":"PHIL:","w":0.029411764144897462,"c":1,"x":0.086505190505405949,"h":0.0087209305119230196},{"c":1,"x":0.084775087650555137,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.036332178115844715,"t":"LUCY:","y":0.70348837176143109},{"c":1,"x":0.084775086061194757,"y":0.75145348814951252,"h":0.011627907349230693,"w":0.031141869227091473,"t":"PHIL:"},{"t":"LUCY:","x":0.083044982901172876,"h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1,"y":0.76744186024657335,"w":0.03806228319803874},{"w":0.031141869227091473,"h":0.010174418263205087,"x":0.084775086061194757,"t":"PHIL:","y":0.7994186047936237,"c":1},{"y":0.83139534862328046,"t":"LUCY:","h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"w":0.03806228319803874,"x":0.083044982886068791},{"t":"But now people are much more aware of that, aren't they?","y":0.10590445567304152,"w":0.40674479166666666,"h":0.018173098313883473,"x":0.16946958305487328,"c":1},{"y":0.12515914761376501,"w":0.09401734034220377,"h":0.014003146353762319,"c":1,"t":"I suppose so.","x":0.16923630685927427},{"w":0.51570139567057294,"c":1,"h":0.017788112872626272,"y":0.13809379039699254,"x":0.16776313875759474,"t":"Another thing about the research is that the team members came from all"},{"y":0.15338703786237251,"c":1,"h":0.018667281132798919,"t":"round the world. Though I suppose that's not unusual nowadays, now everyone","w":0.55204930623372395,"x":0.16948276823388389},{"x":0.16930989501577937,"w":0.1371928532918294,"c":1,"h":0.014922126679256964,"t":"can work remotely.","y":0.17151481031409832},{"h":0.016138908327501755,"t":"Right. I liked the way she didn't bombard us with figures - I mean, they were","x":0.16782007605998842,"y":0.18750000007468381,"w":0.53287195841471358,"c":1},{"y":0.2017559865190186,"w":0.48628092447916665,"t":"available, but she focused more on the general points they indicated.","x":0.16775867919589421,"c":1,"h":0.019258483795956183},{"w":0.55190312703450517,"t":"Mm. And the description of improvements in systems used for tracking marine","y":0.21938418446227259,"x":0.16782006270049882,"h":0.016095171448565537,"c":1},{"x":0.16782006546439376,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"animals and things like robots were really interesting.","w":0.37197232564290361,"y":0.23546511604248055},{"y":0.25145348844683935,"c":1,"x":0.16782007350826006,"t":"Yes, and her description of how robotics can be used to investigate threats to","w":0.53979237874348951,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"y":0.26689111366264251,"h":0.015094686338666286,"t":"biodiversity.","w":0.088921559651692683,"x":0.16754107638028648,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Absolutely.","y":0.28331407891295357,"x":0.16779143778612285,"w":0.083102245330810537,"h":0.014767190974604549},{"t":"While you're here, can we talk about the list of resources we have to evaluate","x":0.1678200735128208,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.32120363906105831,"w":0.53979237874348962},{"x":0.16608996654164959,"y":0.33575581367120666,"w":0.53114186604817704,"h":0.017441861023846261,"c":1,"t":"for the seminar tomorrow. I've had a look at them all, but it's been a bit of a"},{"w":0.53633219401041665,"h":0.016102291638405597,"c":1,"x":0.16782006209484193,"y":0.3677325582103036,"t":"Yeah. What did you think of that article on invasive lionfish? The one claiming"},{"c":1,"t":"they were expanding their habitat throughout the Mediterranean Sea.","y":0.38372093030239818,"x":0.16782006027859808,"w":0.48961939493815099,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.39958012627007577,"c":1,"t":"Well, the writer went on about how dangerous they were in environmental","w":0.51903111775716138,"x":0.16955018498318036},{"y":0.41567529751581778,"w":0.54671279907226566,"t":"terms, which is probably true, but he didn't really provide much information to","x":0.16782007096559728,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.43270146976920743,"h":0.015411013902860371,"t":"explain why.","w":0.090160465240478521,"x":0.16772253547631658},{"h":0.017958384114099335,"c":1,"t":"I know what you mean.","y":0.44728165595522373,"w":0.16675744374593096,"x":0.16576017825421394},{"c":1,"t":"I watched the documentary on microplastics, at least I started to, but then I","x":0.16608995510369348,"y":0.4636109166292226,"w":0.52768168131510418,"h":0.016095171448565315},{"y":0.4784956912290258,"c":1,"h":0.015789256219350012,"w":0.32377764383951824,"t":"found it was made ten years ago so gave up.","x":0.1677227565844864},{"h":0.015988371937820434,"x":0.16608997604603445,"y":0.49563953495879254,"w":0.55709340413411457,"c":1,"t":"I watched to the end but you're right, it was showing its age. People had hardly"},{"t":"heard of microplastics then, whereas now everyone knows about them and how","x":0.16782007412986086,"y":0.5115465357417075,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.55536331176757814,"c":1},{"y":0.52761627918135146,"w":0.14013840993245444,"c":1,"x":0.16955017206498121,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"dangerous they are."},{"t":"Yeah. Did you listen to the podcast on ocean pollution?","x":0.16782007927316489,"h":0.016152130965172096,"c":1,"y":0.54198740364109288,"w":0.38754323323567708},{"h":0.016095171448565537,"c":1,"t":"Mm. I didn't get anything out of it though. Most of it was stating the obvious.","x":0.16782005958003443,"y":0.55808257544004058,"w":0.5432526143391927},{"y":0.5741279068944618,"h":0.016145011442703638,"t":"Yes, it mentioned pesticides and plastic and things, and it clearly made the","x":0.1678200860973206,"w":0.52076121012369792,"c":1},{"x":0.16782008646058594,"w":0.53460205078125012,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"point that they were a bad thing, but everybody knows that anyway. Did you","y":0.59011627898748509},{"c":1,"t":"read that book on coastal ecosystems?","w":0.27162630716959635,"h":0.013296011196641033,"x":0.16955016813659379,"y":0.6060181945990798},{"c":1,"w":0.52941177368164061,"y":0.62209302297349278,"x":0.16782006462712873,"t":"The one by John Harper? Yes, I found it hard going at first, it went into a lot","h":0.017515094402038245},{"c":1,"w":0.54671279907226566,"t":"of detail about things like the effects of offshore windfarms and fish farms, but","x":0.1678200709641603,"y":0.63808139506657491,"h":0.01744186102384615},{"c":1,"x":0.16782007360476067,"h":0.016104325787682394,"t":"actually I ended up with a much better understanding of the issues.","y":0.65395381366606276,"w":0.47058822631835939},{"y":0.66860465137637892,"w":0.51730102539062495,"c":1,"h":0.01753950552810235,"t":"Yes, I agree and I thought it was a well-written summary of those. And the","x":0.16608997178565635},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.16782006948444092,"t":"diagrams helped a lot too.","y":0.68604651169551556,"w":0.18858131408691406},{"x":0.16773803756471711,"y":0.69987650789398603,"w":0.53650024414062503,"t":"The article on metal toxicity was way above my head, I didn't know anything","c":1,"h":0.01818304816019789},{"w":0.5536332194010416,"h":0.013120046606257318,"c":1,"t":"about how metals from industrial emissions react in the ocean... and I still don't","y":0.7179846044301158,"x":0.16782006842082506},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.10034601847330729,"c":1,"t":"understand it.","y":0.73401162801518605,"x":0.16782007027216564},{"w":0.44982696533203126,"t":"I gave up reading after the first chapter - I just couldn't follow it.","y":0.74842547247712521,"x":0.16608997748277332,"h":0.016109411160874165,"c":1},{"x":0.16782006207525019,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.76592022416296845,"w":0.53633219401041665,"t":"That podcast on floating marine cities was interesting, though it presented a"},{"t":"rather one-sided picture, I thought.","y":0.78197674394742844,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"w":0.24913495381673179,"x":0.16782006625980023},{"c":1,"w":0.55536331176757803,"t":"Yes, it focused on how this would benefit people and ignored the effects on the","x":0.16782007411967109,"y":0.796361091902131,"h":0.017592396746155647},{"h":0.013084154015575056,"c":1,"x":0.16942692822117172,"w":0.093784847259521464,"t":"environment.","y":0.81231061459290477},{"y":0.82744148174913568,"w":0.16305212656656901,"t":"But anyway, shall we ...","h":0.019832118563588574,"x":0.167596132879371,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"y":0.9593023253058417,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.084775087012669129,"t":"100"},{"t":"Q23\/24","y":0.21893159161403086,"x":0.74896957509043871,"w":0.059154275258382127,"c":1,"h":0.014171700447568325},{"c":1,"y":0.41569767437924943,"x":0.74913494822589732,"w":0.034602076212565058,"t":"Q25","h":0.01308139510051276},{"t":"Q26","x":0.74913494860917051,"y":0.49563953466517785,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"x":0.7491349479663818,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.59302325559541047,"w":0.034602076212565058,"c":1,"t":"Q27"},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.67005813962270866,"c":1,"t":"Q28","x":0.74913494860917051,"w":0.032871971130371103},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.034602076212565058,"x":0.7491349479663818,"c":1,"t":"Q29","y":0.70348837218084825},{"y":0.76598837217630611,"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q30","x":0.74913494860977115,"c":1}]}